Z||000019||kslish||02-14-2001||01:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>Hey Lisa, if you see this let me know if youd like to come to our club meeting wednesday evening. See how much fun some clubs are. Its in Zanesville.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Hey, what kind of club is this in Zanesville?  Might be worth the drive sometime if it's that much "fun."   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I determined last night at the local Fiero club meeting here that I need to go see how some other clubs do things to come up with ideas to make ours better.  <P>Ken S.<BR>'87 GT and '86 SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000020||rogergarrison||02-14-2001||02:53 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by kslish:<BR><B> <BR>Hey, what kind of club is this in Zanesville?  Might be worth the drive sometime if it's that much "fun."    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I determined last night at the local Fiero club meeting here that I need to go see how some other clubs do things to come up with ideas to make ours better. <P>Its ESCC,(European Sports Car Club of Ohio) Its only open to european manufactured sports cars, sports sedans and replicas of them. We have real Ferraris, Porsches,MGs, Triumph, Panteras, BMW, Mercedes, Jaguars. My Ferrari and another members Porsche 356 spyder are the only replica/kits rite now. We do lots of 1 day road trips on backroads, not just sitting at cruise ins. Go as a group to events like the Vintage Grande Prixs.<P>Ken S.<BR>'87 GT and '86 SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
